WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start KRAB. Choose a deployment path; Custom combines runtime choices. [krab]

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Select the architectures of your cluster nodes. [Enter]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose the Kubernetes distribution used by your cluster. [Enter]

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The overview keeps every configuration section within reach. [Enter]

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Press F1 for contextual help on any screen. [F1]

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Open Runtimes. Arrow keys navigate; checked entries are selected. [↓ × 5, Enter]

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Space toggles a runtime and updates the live configuration panel. [Space]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Preview the generated, version-pinned Helm values before saving. [Enter, p]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Save your configuration to a file you can edit or automate later. [Esc, s]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review the destination and confirm the save. [Enter]
